#error "Invalid configuration: 'TPP_HAVE_MESGPRINTER_HOOK' is configured as 'TPP_HOOK_RT_USER', but 'TPP_HOOK_MESGPRINTER' isn't defined. Configure the hook differently, or supply your definition"
